'''Lights''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It appears to be the [[Default Knife]] with Christmas lights entwined around it.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Lights (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Lights_Set Lights Set]. {{UncommonsNav}}

